blurb = "Depicts Nuribotoke, a yōkai that resembles an animated corpse. Distinguishing attributes in most depictions are its pitch black color and its droopy eyeballs. Its name means \"lacquered Buddha\", and it is supposed to appear at night out of poorly maintained Buddhist shrines."
